// The Textures list on the real plan and the web host: tlist is answered by app.ts (textures.ts), asked with the page in front and the account state (members-reader.contract), so a sign-in
// from the banner asks it again. With no Textures page on top (pg.top is empty in the first moments of the web host, see mail.test.contract) it answers the idle shape (status "loading" in the data), no rows, and
// no request. The web host holds no key, so a sign-in cannot be made here; that the answer is a function of the account state is in textures.test.ts (L8, the generation).
test "with no Textures page on top the list is answered by app.ts and says idle with no rows"
  clock data
  expect state tlist.status == "loading"
  expect state tlist.rows.length == 0
  expect state tlist.hasEdition == false

// The Textures page is mounted from the launcher (the deck shows a placard until it is the page in front). The web host holds no key, so the create cannot succeed here. What this proves: the button is on the
// page and is pressed; the failure comes back as words on the page, tnewBusy is false after the answer, nothing is opened (Textures is still the page
// in front, the editor is not on), and leaving Textures clears the words. NOT proved here: the busy state while a create is out (the web host answers within the press, so the test cannot read it in flight),  a made document opening in the editor (needs a key; the phone shows it) and the account moving mid-create.
test "New document: pressed with no sign-in, it says why, opens nothing, and the words go when Textures is left"
  clock data
  tap "bar-mark"
  clock settle
  tap "place-textures"
  clock settle
  clock data
  expect tree has "textures-new"
  expect state tnewBusy == false
  expect state tnewMessage == ""
  tap "textures-new"
  clock data
  expect state tnewBusy == false
  expect state tnewMessage == "Sign in to make a document."
  expect text "textures-new-message" == "Sign in to make a document."
  expect state pg.top == "textures:"
  expect state edOn == false
  tap "bar-mark"
  clock settle
  tap "place-paper"
  clock settle
  expect state tnewMessage == ""
